commit 6d6e79ea2f2ce13a2b68cd19f7cefc0ac7dcf4bd
Author: kaigani <kaigani@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 2 12:18:47 2026 -0800

    fix(vector): keep a closed retrace's closing parameter across a repeated anchor (C24-R2-07)
    
    Flat keeps the reach parameter of the dropped repeated closing vertex, so the closing
    edge ends there instead of running across the zero-length closing segment. A debug-only
    cut invariant checks that cuts partition the traversal once and lie at their junctions.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

